      "writtenOn": "2022-12-13T21:54:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Shouldn\u0027t we check with a endWith instead ?\n\nIn my understanding, the start of an address define the device manufacturer / class of device witch are standard and allow people to retrieve the device model from it, while the last 3 digits are more random.",
